{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And a meal-offering mingled.</b> And the same is true that it requires frankincense, as we say in the section of ויקרא, and so we learned in the chapter כל המנחות: 'they come matzah' — to include the meal-offering of the eighth day for frankincense." "<b>For today HaShem will appear to you.</b> And it is fitting to sacrifice and to be seen before Him with several types of offerings stated in the matter: sin-offering, burnt-offering, meal-offering, and peace-offerings."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:54.475589730Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}